       9104's lanes:forward + lanes:backward doesn't add up to lanes;
       9203 only_straight_on from Oak west, whose lanes still turn left.
       Relations: 9201 no_left_turn east -> south; 9202 no_u_turn on Main
       south; 9203 only_straight_on west -> east. -->
